//        -each 'country="FR", code=String(this.properties.code)' \
//        -filter-fields name,code,country \
//        -simplify percentage=10% keep-shapes \
//        -o precision=0.0001 format=geojson out.geojson
//   3. paste its features into the array below.
// Because "code" is only unique per country, use country + code as the key
// whenever you need a unique id (see provinceKey() in the section).

